# VidSlide Environment Configuration
# When deployed on Vercel, set this in your Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# Points to your deployed FastAPI backend (e.g. Render, Railway, Fly.io, or VPS).
# In local development, leave this empty to use Vite's dev proxy (http://localhost:8000).

VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-service.onrender.com
